<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes comparison functions for vector types that take a user defined epsilon values.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_ext_2vector__relational_8hpp">glm/ext/vector_relational.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para>core_vector_relational </para>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__scalar__relational">GLM_EXT_scalar_relational</link> </para>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__matrix__relational">GLM_EXT_matrix_relational</link></para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
